WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.610
OraVisionAI supports preliminary oral-health screening,

2
00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.900
with professional clinical oversight.

3
00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.330
Patients begin by recording notes

4
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.010
and uploading an oral photograph

5
00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.000
for AI-assisted image analysis.

6
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.850
EfficientNetB0 classifies the image

7
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:16.850
across seven oral conditions.

8
00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:20.550
Independently, YOLO localizes visible findings.

9
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.390
Results bring together model confidence,

10
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.290
class probabilities, explainable heatmaps,

11
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.050
and clinical-risk prioritization.

12
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.030
These are screening findings,

13
00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.850
not a confirmed diagnosis.

14
00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.000
Patients request an approved dentist’s review.

15
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.650
The dentist examines the original image

16
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.490
and AI evidence,

17
00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.790
then records a separate professional assessment

18
00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.150
and recommendations.

19
00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.850
A consolidated report brings the findings together.

20
00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:50.330
OraVisionAI combines artificial intelligence

21
00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.090
with clinical oversight,

22
00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.500
supporting structured oral-health assessment.

